  "title": "Chocolate Chip Cookies VII",
  "description": "This was a recipe I got from tripling one of the online recipes for chocolate chip cookies and making a few changes and variations in amount to some ingredients. I&#39;ve gotten great feedback from them.",
  "authors": [
